# ---------------- Autoconfig daisy chain (J2 header, via U6, 10k pullup to 5V on CFGIN) ----------------
LOCATE COMP "cfgin_n"  SITE "B1";   # carrier net PL2A, SODIMM 77
IOBUF  PORT "cfgin_n"  IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULLMODE=UP;
LOCATE COMP "cfgout_n" SITE "B2";   # carrier net PL2B, SODIMM 79
IOBUF  PORT "cfgout_n" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULLMODE=UP DRIVE=8;

# ---------------- CBT bus-switch output enables (active LOW = connected) ----------------
LOCATE COMP "cbt_oe_d0_7_n" SITE "K3";   # U2: D0-D7 (net PL20D, SODIMM 156)
IOBUF  PORT "cbt_oe_d0_7_n" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULLMODE=UP DRIVE=4;
LOCATE COMP "cbt_oe_d8_15_n" SITE "E3";   # U3: D8-D15 (net PL5C, SODIMM 138)
IOBUF  PORT "cbt_oe_d8_15_n" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULLMODE=UP DRIVE=4;
LOCATE COMP "cbt_oe_ctl_hi_n" SITE "C8";   # U4: RW,LDS,UDS,AS,A18-A23 (net PT35A, SODIMM 114)
IOBUF  PORT "cbt_oe_ctl_hi_n" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULLMODE=UP DRIVE=4;
LOCATE COMP "cbt_oe_a8_17_n" SITE "P12";   # U7: A8-A17 (net PR47D, SODIMM 44)
IOBUF  PORT "cbt_oe_a8_17_n" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULLMODE=UP DRIVE=4;
